+
+// Windows Phone 8.1 replacement for the sandbox broker/target entry points.
+//
+// A Phone 8.1 package already runs inside its AppContainer, and the Phone port
+// runs every Chromium component in that single process (--single-process).
+// The desktop broker needs NT internals, window stations, restricted tokens
